OL,3,GNEWSAUniversity's #16m savings will
OL,4,Alead to 150 job losses, says union
OL,5,
OL,6,FMajor cutbacks at Aberystwyth
OL,7,FUniversity will lead to 150 jobs being
OL,8,Flost, a union has said.
OL,10,FThe university has announced a "further
OL,11,Fphase of its restructure" with the aim
OL,12,Fof saving #16m by the end of 2027-28.
OL,14,FIt said there would be a review of "all
OL,15,Facademic units" which follows an
OL,16,Fongoing review of non-academic
OL,17,Fdepartments as the higher education
OL,18,Fsector goes through "unprecedented
OL,19,Fchallenges".
